<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap--narrow stack-lg">
    <h2>How we operate</h2>
    <p><strong>We look at the house.</strong> Somebody from Monthaven walks every property in
    person before we make an offer. We don't send algorithmic numbers and then "adjust" after
    the walkthrough.</p>
    <p><strong>We put it in writing.</strong> Verbal offers are how people get moved off a
    number later. Ours comes in writing with the math behind it.</p>
    <p><strong>We don't re-trade you on condition.</strong> The number doesn't move because of
    what's in the house. The only things that can void a contract are outside both our hands,
    and we name them up front.</p>
    <p><strong>We tell you when to walk away.</strong> If listing with an agent would net you
    more, or if a repayment plan with your servicer solves the problem, we'll say so. We'd
    rather lose the deal.</p>
    <p><strong>We don't sell your information.</strong> Your address and phone number come to
    us, not to a list.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow stack-lg">
    <h2>What we are not</h2>
    <p>
      We're a real estate investment company. We buy houses directly with our own funds,
      renovate them, and either sell or hold them. We're not attorneys, accountants, or
      financial advisors, and nothing on this site is legal, tax, or financial advice.
    </p>
    <p class="small muted">{{ site.name }} is a trade name of {{ site.legalName }}.</p>
  </div>
</section>

